  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chickpeas, sesame butter, and water to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent the chickpeas from sticking to the bottom of the pot.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
